    "Answer in 100–300 words, the way you'd normally write it. Skip any that don't fit you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Responde en 100–300 palabras, como escribirías normalmente. Sáltate las que no vayan contigo."
